"last_played": 1702417370, "avatar": "37057b2f721fe5f6dd399501c274cb1d27cb1de4"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a souls-like shooter that relies less in perfect dodges, and instead requires aiming. This works as a great combination for me. Different difficulty levels combined with rerolling the campaigns resulting in different campaigns makes the game re-playable. It deserved a chance.", "timestamp_created": 1701991911, "timestamp_updated": 1701991911, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153080728", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059516389", "personaname": "Oguri Cap", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TankPoss/", "num_games_owned": 682, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 5813, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4715, "last_played": 1771770817, "avatar": "72ca1b643036dafc09fbd8c985ee9db152b39998"}, "language": "english", "review": "Remnant from the ashes was a game I didnt give a chance for a long time. Until i eventually picked it up around 6 months ago and loved every second of it. I wasnt sure how much it could improve coming into the sequel but i am blown away with how much stuff has been added/improved and how much they managed to do with the same locations from the previous game.\n\nIf you want a game that gives you the best of Roguelike generation of areas, looter shooters and dark souls difficulty/mechanics; this is the game for you.\n\nThe only downside is there isnt much added in terms of locations, same as the last game theres 3-4 planets and the labyrinth, i was hoping for at least 6 different open areas but with the ammount of secrets crammed into each world and the different branching storylines you can follow, it more than makes up for this.\n\ngreat game. 7/10", "timestamp_created": 1701991685, "timestamp_updated": 1701991685, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153080070", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079628431", "personaname": "Gregory", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079628431/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 21846, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4266, "last_played": 1748667413, "avatar": "5a2b5024cc186e1e876172ed2702bc94e8fb0d04"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game runs with the bulls and swims with the dolphins.  Games like this are above what people think of it.", "timestamp_created": 1701991006, "timestamp_updated": 1701991006, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153079881", "author": {"steamid": "76561198145683784", "personaname": "rander", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198145683784/", "num_games_owned": 211, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 2177, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1708, "last_played": 1702240254, "avatar": "9368fc7c1d9ce0d0102d60ba8a105c1a34c36145"}, "language": "english", "review": "Thanks for picking me up Allysiah", "timestamp_created": 1701990799, "timestamp_updated": 1701990799, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": fals